msgid "For small inputs, the faster computer wins. As the input size grows, binary search wins, even though it runs on the slower computer. **The time complexity of the algorithm matters as the input size increases.**"
msgstr "对于小规模输入，较快的计算机胜出。随着输入规模增大，即使二分查找运行在较慢的计算机上，它也会胜出。**随着输入规模的增大，算法的时间复杂度起着决定性作用。**"

msgid "In short:"
msgstr "简而言之："

msgid "**Measurements** evaluate how an implementation performs for a given input on a given computer."
msgstr "**测量**评估的是某个实现在给定计算机上、对给定输入的表现。"

msgid "**Complexity analysis** predicts how an algorithm performs for large inputs, regardless of the computer."
msgstr "**复杂度分析**预测的是算法在大规模输入下的表现，与计算机无关。"

msgid "In the next section, we will make this idea more formal."
msgstr "在下一节中，我们会把这个想法形式化。"

